{"articleNo":"2915","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2915&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"부전공 신청 안내(2011학년도 2학기)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.08.03","hit":"9700","attachments":[{"name":"이수신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2915&attachNo=2535"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">부전공 이수신청 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY목각파임B&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">011학년도 2학기 부전공 이수신청에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내하오니</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">◀</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">▶</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 신청 기간</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : <u><strong>2011. 8. 4(목) ～ 8. 8(월)</strong></u></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 신청 장소 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">해당 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 제출 서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 부전공 이수 신청서 1부(첨부자료 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 성적증명서 1부</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 신청학부 및 전공 :&nbsp;첨부자료 참조</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -86.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 86.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">5. 신청 자격</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 2학년부터 이수할 수 있으며, 이수신청 직전학기까지의&nbsp; 평점평균이 3.00이상이어야 함. </span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -91.1pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 91.1pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6. 신청 방법</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> : 부전공 이수 신청서와 성적증명서를 소속 학부장의 추천을 받아 부전공 해당 종합학사행정실에 제출.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">7. 허용 인원 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">: 전공별 입학정원의 50%이내에서 선발함.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2011년&nbsp;&nbsp; 8월&nbsp;&nbsp; 3일 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 24pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">교 무 연 구 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
